note a notes app: the page, the server, and a memory that lasts
allow remembering in the file notes.json
when someone visits the path home do
show a heading with the words My notes end words
let notes be what I remember called notes as a list of text or else an empty list of text
for each saved in notes do
show a paragraph with saved
end for
show a box called note
show a paragraph called answer with the words Write something and press the button. end words
show a button with the words Save note end words that asks the path save and shows the reply in the paragraph called answer
reply with the page
end when
when someone visits the path save do
let newnote be the visitor sent note
if newnote is the words end words then
reply with the words Please write something first. end words
end if
if length of newnote is greater than 200 then
reply with the words That note is too long. end words
end if
let notes be what I remember called notes as a list of text or else an empty list of text
add newnote to notes
remember notes as notes
reply with the words Saved. Reload the page to see it. end words
end when
start the server on port 8096
